<title>USA: McDonnell Douglas sets $250 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>McDonnell Douglas sets $250 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from McDonnell Douglas was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER MCDONNELL DOUGLAS CORP</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 6.875 PCT  MATURITY 11/01/2006</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.182  FIRST PAY DATE 05/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD 6.99 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-MINUS   SPREAD +63 BP     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
